      "text": [
        " سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) عَنِ الْمَرْأَةِ الْمُتَمَتِّعَةِ تَطُوفُ بِالْبَيْتِ وَ بِالصَّفَا وَ الْمَرْوَةِ لِلْحَجِّ ثُمَّ تَرْجِعُ إِلَى مِنًى قَبْلَ أَنْ تَطُوفَ بِالْبَيْتِ فَقَالَ أَ لَيْسَ تَزُورُ الْبَيْتَ قُلْتُ بَلَى قَالَ فَلْتَطُفْ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Muhammad Bin Sinan, from Ibn Muskan, from Al Halby who said, ",
          "‘I asked Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> about the woman performing <span class=\"iTxt\">Tumatto</span> performing <span class=\"iTxt\">Tawaaf</span> by the House (Kabah), and by Al-Safa and Al-Marwa for the Hajj. Then she returns to Mina before she performs <span class=\"iTxt\">Tawaaf</span> of the House (Kabah)’. So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Did she not visit the House (Kabah)?’ I said, ‘Yes’. He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘So let her perform <span class=\"iTxt\">Tawaaf</span>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "6. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from Muhammad ibn Sinan from ibn Muskan from al-Halabiy who has said the following: “I once asked abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, about a woman for al-Tamattu‘ (advantageous) who performs Tawaf around the House, performs Sa‘y between al-Safa’ and al-Marwah for al-Hajj; then returns to Mina’ before performing Tawaf around the House. He (the Imam) said, ‘Is it not a fact that she must visit the House?’ I replied, ‘Yes, it is true.’ He (the Imam) said, ‘She then must perform Tawaf.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
